 "Заметь главное. После центра остались четыре цифры": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">крестик заполнен</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">ряд = 9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">столбик</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">= 10</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">оставшиеся четыре цифры делятся без спора</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">5</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">пара ряда {2, 3} → 5</span> &nbsp;+&nbsp; <span style=\"color:var(--green)\">пара столбика {1, 5} → 6</span> &nbsp;=&nbsp; 11</div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">центр 4</span> входит и в ряд, и в столбик — якорь 9 + 10 = 15 + ц выдал его без перебора</div><figcaption>Ряд без центра просит 5, столбик без центра — 6, а всего осталось 11: пары делят четыре цифры нацело и ни за одну не спорят — потому Р и С считаются врозь и перемножаются.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Пары с суммой 9": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">десять цифр — ровно пять пар, каждая цифра в одной</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\"><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">0</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono);opacity:.55\">+</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">9</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">1</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono);opacity:.55\">+</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">8</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">2</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono);opacity:.55\">+</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">7</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">3</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono);opacity:.55\">+</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">6</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">4</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono);opacity:.55\">+</span><span style=\"font:15px var(--mono)\">5</span></span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">пару забрала верхняя строка</span> → нижней остались целыми четыре</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">одна из 80 таблиц</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,38px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">0</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">6</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">строка = 9</div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">П = 5 пар &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2 порядка &nbsp;·&nbsp; Н = 4 пары &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2 порядка</div><figcaption>Пары не задевают друг друга: забрал одну целиком — остальные четыре остались целыми, поэтому второй множитель ровно 4, а не 5.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Вершины через одну равны": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">в1 и в3 — по диагонали, в2 и в4 — по другой</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,40px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">a</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">b</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">ц</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">b</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:transparent\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">a</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">два треугольника с общей частью</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\">ц + <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">в1</span> + <span style=\"color:var(--green)\">в2</span> = 15</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\">ц + <span style=\"color:var(--green)\">в2</span> + <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">в3</span> = 15</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">общее ц и в2 убираю → <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">в1 = в3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">на вершинах всего два разных числа: <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">a = в1 = в3</span> и <span style=\"color:var(--green)\">b = в2 = в4</span> — и все четыре треугольника сливаются в одно равенство ц + a + b = 15</div><figcaption>Равенство вершин через одну не увидено на картинке, а получено вычитанием общей части двух соседних треугольников — на другой фигуре чередование ляжет иначе.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Три полных порции — это клетки 1–9": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(11,34px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">10</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">11</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">остаток 1 — клетки 1, 4, 7, 10 · число 5 · 4 клетки</span><br><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">остаток 2 — клетки 2, 5, 8, 11 · число 6 · 4 клетки</span><br><span style=\"color:var(--green)\">остаток 0 — клетки 3, 6, 9 · число 4 · 3 клетки</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">11 = 3 · 3 + 2 — три полных порции (клетки 1–9) и хвост в две клетки, а хвост достался первым двум полочкам</div><figcaption>Полочки не поровну: хвост длиной 2 добавил по клетке только первым двум — поэтому 4, 4 и 3, а не «примерно по четыре».</figcaption></figure>",
 "Шаг 2 — период сжимает доску": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,36px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">t₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">12</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">t₃</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">t₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">12</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">t₃</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">t₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">12</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₂</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₃</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">10</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₂</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₃</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">m₂</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₂</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₃</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₂</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₁</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\">b₂</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">период 3 по горизонтали: столбец 4 — копия 1-го, 5-й — копия 2-го, 6-й — копия 3-го. Значит разных столбцов всего три, и равенств-столбцов тоже три, а не восемь.</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">вписанные числа</span> сели каждое на свою полочку: 12 — «остаток 2» верхней строки, 10 — «остаток 1» средней, 5 — «остаток 0» нижней</div><figcaption>По вертикали периода нет: столбец из трёх клеток — это и есть одна тройка подряд, про него известно ровно одно равенство.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Пример: сетка 4×4, помеченная клетка стоит": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">помеченная клетка (2, 2)</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,32px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">•</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">левые верхние клетки окон 2×2, накрывающих её</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,32px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">▪</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">▪</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">▪</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">▪</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">строки 1–2 <span style=\"opacity:.6\">×</span> столбцы 1–2 → 4 окна</div></div></div><figcaption>Окно названо своей левой верхней клеткой — второго окна с тем же углом и размером не бывает, поэтому считать окна можно, считая клетки-углы.</figcaption></figure>"
